  "heat_west_only": "強",
  "muggy_west_only": "強",
  "heat_muggy_west_evidence": "[おぎはら/品種] 耐暑性；強\n[おぎはら楽天/品種] 耐湿性: やや弱い 緑がかります 高温多湿が 苦手です（蒸れ 弱 相当）\n[食い違い] 蒸れ: 欧米の文献は 強 相当。控えめな側を採った\n[MBG/種] Tolerant of heat, humidity and drought, but generally grows taller with consistent moisture.\n[NC State/種] Muhly grass tolerates heat, humidity, drought, and poor soil and is highly salt-tolerant.\n[RHS/品種] Aspect: East-facing or South-facing or West-facing",
